# Surge cn.list for Back-to-China routing
# Generated: 2026-06-03
# AUTHOR: JovanyKoch
# Usage in [Rule]:
# RULE-SET,https://example.com/cn.list,BackToCN
# or local:
# RULE-SET,cn.list,BackToCN
#
# Notes:
# - This is a policy-less external RULE-SET. Bind the policy in the parent RULE-SET line.
# - Keep this list above generic global/proxy rules.
# - If DNS behavior is sensitive, place IP/GEOIP fallback in the main profile instead.

